From: vincenzopio <43883474+vincenzopio@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 20:48:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] service: find the game's package for the launcher.

LAUNCHER_PACKAGE takes a game's Store ID and a market, and answers with the version of the
package Microsoft serves now and the size of its download, without downloading it. The store's
catalog names the package's content for Windows desktops, and the Xbox package service describes
it, given an Xbox token of the user for http://update.xboxlive.com. That token comes from the same
chain as the gamertag's, now shared. Patches from earlier versions (.xsp) do not count in the
size.

Original work for macrock (GPL-3.0-only, as Xodus).

Topic: install
